WEBVTT

00:00:19.137 --> 00:00:21.556
-[dragons growling]
-[snaps fingers]

00:00:24.892 --> 00:00:26.686
[low growling]

00:00:31.941 --> 00:00:34.360
[quietly] Okay, split up.
We'll be harder to catch.

00:00:35.486 --> 00:00:38.072
I was thinking we should split up.
Just because.

00:00:38.156 --> 00:00:39.490
[whispers] I like your instincts.

00:00:40.783 --> 00:00:41.868
What is this?

00:00:49.333 --> 00:00:50.334
[rock clatters]

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:54.046
[gasps and grunts]

00:01:15.526 --> 00:01:16.903
[gasps]

00:01:17.528 --> 00:01:19.322
[chain net rumbling]

00:01:21.199 --> 00:01:22.700
[Fishmeat squealing]

00:01:22.783 --> 00:01:23.784
Quiet!

00:01:24.535 --> 00:01:26.537
[Grimmel] Where's your dragon
when you need him?

00:01:26.954 --> 00:01:28.331
Hmm, Chief?

00:01:28.915 --> 00:01:30.917
Must've forgotten all about you.

00:01:31.083 --> 00:01:32.210
[chuckles]

00:01:32.293 --> 00:01:36.672
First rule of the hunt,
separate the prey from its pack.

00:01:36.756 --> 00:01:40.510
You've just removed yourselves
from the equation.

00:01:40.676 --> 00:01:42.428
-Why are you doing this?
-[Grimmel] Really?

00:01:42.887 --> 00:01:44.764
I didn't think you cared.

00:01:45.306 --> 00:01:49.435
Well, unlike you, when I was a boy
and I came upon a Night Fury,

00:01:49.519 --> 00:01:51.812
I killed it where it slept.

00:01:52.313 --> 00:01:56.275
That simple act of courage
made me a hero in my village.

00:01:56.776 --> 00:01:59.946
So I decided to kill every last one,

00:02:00.029 --> 00:02:03.658
bringing real peace
to the people of this world.

00:02:03.741 --> 00:02:07.078
Until you came along,
preaching that dragons

00:02:07.161 --> 00:02:10.873
are something other than thieves
and murderers.

00:02:10.957 --> 00:02:12.250
[scoffs]

00:02:12.333 --> 00:02:15.711
That nonsense dies now. Starting with you.

00:02:15.795 --> 00:02:18.047
-But you have dragons of your own.
-[Grimmel laughs]

00:02:18.506 --> 00:02:19.757
These?

00:02:20.383 --> 00:02:22.176
They're dragon killers,

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:25.346
drugged into obedience
with their own venom.

00:02:25.429 --> 00:02:28.724
Not even your precious alpha
could control them.

00:02:28.808 --> 00:02:32.061
They serve me and only me.

00:02:32.144 --> 00:02:34.564
Allow me to demonstrate. [whistles]

00:02:34.689 --> 00:02:35.982
Take cover!

00:02:40.653 --> 00:02:41.821
[Astrid] Split up!

00:02:41.904 --> 00:02:43.114
[Tuffnut] Whoa!

00:02:45.283 --> 00:02:46.117
[grunts]

00:02:48.995 --> 00:02:49.996
[Astrid] Whoa! Run!

00:02:53.207 --> 00:02:54.959
[panting]

00:02:55.042 --> 00:02:56.502
[grunts]

00:02:56.711 --> 00:02:58.462
-[shouts and grunts]
-[dragon roars]

00:03:01.882 --> 00:03:03.759
[Valka grunting]

00:03:09.807 --> 00:03:10.891
Up here.

00:03:12.685 --> 00:03:13.686
[gasps]

00:03:17.315 --> 00:03:18.149
[grunts]

00:03:19.817 --> 00:03:21.485
-[grunts]
-[dragon squeals]

00:03:22.528 --> 00:03:23.613
[roars]

00:03:26.866 --> 00:03:28.117
Hurry!

00:03:30.202 --> 00:03:31.537
[Snotlout] Go, go, go!

00:03:34.457 --> 00:03:35.583
[Valka] Hiccup!

00:03:35.666 --> 00:03:37.376
[panting]

00:03:39.587 --> 00:03:41.464
[roars]

00:03:41.547 --> 00:03:43.841
-[Hiccup] Gotcha!
-[Valka] Go, Cloudjumper.

00:03:44.592 --> 00:03:46.385
[screeching]

00:03:50.348 --> 00:03:51.724
Yeah!

00:03:51.807 --> 00:03:53.893
Our hero!

00:03:56.062 --> 00:03:57.688
[dragons screeching]

00:03:58.648 --> 00:03:59.857
[rumbling]

00:04:02.151 --> 00:04:04.695
-[dragons calling]
-[Fishmeat squealing]

00:04:05.196 --> 00:04:06.364
Hmm.

00:04:06.447 --> 00:04:09.200
Ugh, he takes that stupid baby everywhere.

00:04:14.914 --> 00:04:16.082
[Gobber] Thor almighty!

00:04:16.248 --> 00:04:18.125
Guess we won't be needing this then, huh?

00:04:18.876 --> 00:04:20.586
I led us right into his trap.

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:22.213
Yeah, nice work, Chief.

00:04:22.296 --> 00:04:24.006
-Right, Ruff?
-[snarls softly]

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:25.091
Wait.

00:04:25.257 --> 00:04:26.717
-Uh...
-Where is Ruffnut?

00:04:26.801 --> 00:04:28.511
We... We left her behind?

00:04:28.594 --> 00:04:30.554
How could you not notice she was missing?

00:04:30.638 --> 00:04:32.348
You ride a two-headed dragon.

00:04:32.431 --> 00:04:33.641
Oh, yeah.

00:04:33.724 --> 00:04:36.894
I feel like how Ruffnut
is every day. Dumb.

00:04:36.978 --> 00:04:38.562
Odin be spanked!

00:04:38.646 --> 00:04:40.606
This just gets better and better.

00:04:40.773 --> 00:04:42.066
[others grumbling]

00:04:42.149 --> 00:04:44.860
[Tuffnut] I try to avoid looking at her.
It gives me acid reflux.

00:04:44.944 --> 00:04:47.530
Okay, guys, just keep your helmets on.

00:04:47.613 --> 00:04:48.739
Toothless and I will find her.

00:04:48.823 --> 00:04:50.741
Toothless has the Light Fury now.

00:04:50.908 --> 00:04:52.868
He's probably not even coming back.

00:04:52.952 --> 00:04:53.786
What?

00:04:53.869 --> 00:04:55.746
You gave him his freedom, Hiccup.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:56.956
What were you expecting?

00:04:57.039 --> 00:04:59.208
I never thought he'd stay away for good.

00:04:59.291 --> 00:05:01.335
I... I... [sighs]

00:05:02.253 --> 00:05:05.089
Look, I'll figure it out.
I just need more time.

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:09.677
He thinks he has to lead alone.

00:05:11.012 --> 00:05:12.513
Because his father had to.

00:05:13.097 --> 00:05:16.308
He doesn't realize the strength
you have together.

00:05:17.309 --> 00:05:19.103
Do you still believe in him?

00:05:19.186 --> 00:05:20.479
Of course.

00:05:20.563 --> 00:05:22.273
I wish he did.

00:05:22.356 --> 00:05:25.693
But he thinks he's nothing
without Toothless.

00:05:26.944 --> 00:05:29.196
Then help him realize the truth.

00:05:32.908 --> 00:05:33.909
[squawks]

00:05:34.285 --> 00:05:35.286
-Get on.
-What?

00:05:35.369 --> 00:05:36.370
We're going to find him.

00:05:37.204 --> 00:05:38.205
Really?

00:05:38.956 --> 00:05:40.249
[Stormfly snarls]

00:05:40.332 --> 00:05:42.251
[Hiccup] Everybody, stay put.

00:05:42.334 --> 00:05:44.712
We will get Ruffnut back. Don't worry.

00:05:45.087 --> 00:05:47.798
[scoffs] Worry?
If they're stuck with Ruffnut,

00:05:47.882 --> 00:05:50.426
I'm more worried about them. [chuckles]

00:05:52.011 --> 00:05:54.513
Why the long face? [laughs]

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:56.766
I mean, mine's long,
but yours is really long.

00:05:56.849 --> 00:05:59.393
All face and no brain.
Like you got stretched at birth.

00:05:59.477 --> 00:06:00.811
Do you have a twin, too?

00:06:00.895 --> 00:06:02.813
Tuffnut took up all the room
in Mom's belly.

00:06:02.897 --> 00:06:04.690
Otherwise I'd have a rounder head
and more brains.

00:06:04.774 --> 00:06:06.776
-That's science.
-[groans]

00:06:07.193 --> 00:06:09.028
My braids are like little Zipplebacks.
See?

00:06:09.111 --> 00:06:11.197
[imitates dragons roaring]

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:14.033
Even the mold spots look like eyes.
It's so cute.

00:06:14.116 --> 00:06:15.409
They even have
little horns and everything,

00:06:15.493 --> 00:06:16.494
just like Barf and Belch.

00:06:16.577 --> 00:06:19.413
Except me and Barf can't stand Belch,
so they're really just Barfs.

00:06:19.497 --> 00:06:20.498
It's warm in here.

00:06:21.332 --> 00:06:22.875
I know what you're thinking.

00:06:22.958 --> 00:06:25.169
You've never had a prisoner this hot.

00:06:26.337 --> 00:06:29.423
All the boys love me.
Except Eret, who totally lost his chance.

00:06:29.507 --> 00:06:31.967
That ship has sailed, boy. Sorry.

00:06:32.051 --> 00:06:35.179
And Hiccup is practically married
to that round-head, Astrid.

00:06:35.262 --> 00:06:38.015
But Snotlout and Fishlegs,
they're basically my harem.

00:06:38.099 --> 00:06:39.892
-[sighs]
-I just can't choose, you know?

00:06:39.975 --> 00:06:42.520
Snotlout's a beefcake,
but almost too pretty, you know?

00:06:42.603 --> 00:06:45.106
Sometimes I think he's more
in love with himself than me.

00:06:45.189 --> 00:06:47.900
There's only room for one beauty
in this relationship.

00:06:48.067 --> 00:06:50.069
[chuckles]
Fishlegs would keep me alive longer

00:06:50.152 --> 00:06:52.696
if I had to eat one of them,
stranded on some glacier somewhere.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:54.406
-But he never shuts up about dragons.
-[grunts softly]

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:56.200
Don't you hate when people
never stop talking?

00:06:56.283 --> 00:06:57.576
-Yes, I do.
-They just keep going and going.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:06:59.912
Blah, blah, blah. It's so boring.

00:07:00.037 --> 00:07:01.997
-Can't we just feed her to your dragons?
-[Ruffnut] I'm hungry.

00:07:02.081 --> 00:07:03.290
Hey, what do you have to eat around here?

00:07:03.374 --> 00:07:04.834
I'm allergic to fish.
You should know that.

00:07:04.917 --> 00:07:07.628
That's all they have
at that stupid new island.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:09.672
Do you have any clams?

00:07:09.755 --> 00:07:11.423
They're like little mouths
with slimy food inside

00:07:11.507 --> 00:07:13.926
that's already chewed,
like the way Mom used to do it.

00:07:14.093 --> 00:07:15.136
Enough!

00:07:16.929 --> 00:07:19.181
Until I turned 12 and she was like,
"Chew your own food."

00:07:19.265 --> 00:07:20.808
And I was like, "No, I kinda like it."

00:07:20.891 --> 00:07:23.477
Most annoying creature
ever to cross my path.

00:07:23.561 --> 00:07:25.062
[gasps] Aw.

00:07:26.188 --> 00:07:28.524
Oops, you let the dragons out.

00:07:28.607 --> 00:07:31.193
I'm gonna get you. I'm gonna get you.
No, this one's gonna get you.

00:07:31.277 --> 00:07:32.611
-[Ruffnut laughs]
-Get...

00:07:32.862 --> 00:07:34.446
Take him and go!

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:37.241
Please. I beg you.

00:07:37.324 --> 00:07:39.785
The Deathgrippers will have
to forgo dinner.

00:07:39.869 --> 00:07:42.913
Ew. You feed your dragons dragons?

00:07:42.997 --> 00:07:43.998
Go!

00:07:44.123 --> 00:07:46.125
Where's your bathroom?
I gotta... [clicks tongue]

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:47.543
Okay!

00:07:47.626 --> 00:07:49.670
Gods, no wonder you have gray hair.

00:07:49.753 --> 00:07:51.172
[dragon groans]

00:07:51.797 --> 00:07:53.716
Stress is not good for you.

00:07:53.799 --> 00:07:55.634
[laughs]

00:07:55.718 --> 00:07:57.928
So long, losers!

00:08:07.354 --> 00:08:08.439
[Hiccup] Where... where is she heading?

00:08:08.522 --> 00:08:10.065
She's tracking something.

00:08:10.149 --> 00:08:11.775
-Aren't you, girl?
-[snarls]

00:08:11.942 --> 00:08:14.778
There's nothing but miles and miles of...

00:08:15.112 --> 00:08:17.114
[water rushing]

